{"id":"4ab9e67d837fd090","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_FConseq.md","title":"FConseq","display":"FConseq","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"FConseq","parameters":["E","F","R","f","r","g","a"],"formula_kind":"relational_abbreviation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"FConseq"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>E</span><span>F</span><span>R</span><span>f</span><span>r</span><span>g</span><span>a</span></div>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"relational_abbreviation"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：一阶集合语义。有序参数：<code>E</code>、<code>F</code>、<code>R</code>、<code>f</code>、<code>r</code>、<code>g</code>、<code>a</code>。</p>\n<p>精确含义以本页公式体及其全部依赖为准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ FConseq E F R f r g a)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(and\n  (@ FForms E F R f r g)\n  (and\n    (@ FFm E F R f r a)\n    (forall D\n      (forall I\n        (forall J\n          (forall e\n            (implies\n              (and\n                (@ FModel E F R f r D I J)\n                (and (@ FAssign D e) (forall b (implies (in b g) (@ FSat E F R f r D I J e b)))))\n              (@ FSat E F R f r D I J e a))))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b1aebb86096a232a\" href=\"?note=b1aebb86096a232a\" title=\"ZFC_FAssign\">FAssign</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7d109a270c3f3d46\" href=\"?note=7d109a270c3f3d46\" title=\"ZFC_FFm\">FFm</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"15560da670442c2e\" href=\"?note=15560da670442c2e\" title=\"ZFC_FForms\">FForms</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"debeca760396db21\" href=\"?note=debeca760396db21\" title=\"ZFC_FModel\">FModel</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c284b26e0e1daa9f\" href=\"?note=c284b26e0e1daa9f\" title=\"ZFC_FSat\">FSat</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>本页只定义缩写，不声称其一般元理论性质已经获得内核证明。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ FConseq E F R f r g a)` 按 [[000_ZFC/01_language|无捕获缩写规则]] 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FAssign","status":"resolved","id":"b1aebb86096a232a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FForms|FForms]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FFm","status":"resolved","id":"7d109a270c3f3d46","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FForms|FForms]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FForms","status":"resolved","id":"15560da670442c2e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FForms|FForms]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FModel","status":"resolved","id":"debeca760396db21","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"直接依赖","excerpt":"[[ZFC_FAssign|FAssign]]；[[ZFC_FFm|FFm]]；[[ZFC_FForms|FForms]]；[[ZFC_FModel|FModel]]；[[ZFC_FSat|FSat]]","embed":false},{"target":"ZFC_FSat","status":"resolved","id":"c284b